{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46145","headline":"赠锺陵陈处士 · 贯休","name":"赠锺陵陈处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"否极方生社稷才，唯谭帝道鄙梯媒。\n高吟千首精怪动，长啸一声天地开。\n湖上独居多草木，山前频醉过风雷。\n吾皇仄席求贤久，莫待徵书两度来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}